User "1" -- "0..1" Resident : profile
User "1" -- "0..1" MHO : profile
User "1" -- "0..1" Admin : profile
User "0..1" --> "0..*" Assessment : user_id nullable
Assessment "1" -- "0..*" AssessmentSymptom : symptoms
Symptom "1" -- "0..*" AssessmentSymptom : selected symptom
Assessment "1" -- "0..*" PreMedication : guidance
LexiconRuleBase "0..1" -- "0..*" LexiconRule : contains
RiskLevel "0..1" -- "0..*" LexiconRule : reference
GuideLevel "0..1" -- "0..*" LexiconRule : reference
Assessment "1" -- "0..*" AssessmentCaseActivity : case history
User "1" -- "0..*" AssessmentCaseActivity : recorded by
User "0..1" ..> "0..*" AnalysisReport : user_id nullable
SymptomLexicon ..> Symptom : canonical term match, not a foreign key

note for Assessment "Combines the UML HealthAssessment and HealthAssessmentResult in the current schema. Anonymous assessments use a null user_id."
note for LexiconRule "Administrative/reference data. Live risk classification remains in app/nlp/rules.py and does not read these rows."
note for SymptomLexicon "Maps user phrases to canonical terms; no direct database relationship to Symptom."
note for MedicationCatalog "Reference catalog; PreMedication stores the assessment-specific guidance snapshot."
